      "amount": "½ tsp"
    },
    {
      "name": "fresh parsley, chopped",
      "amount": "2 tbsp",
      "notes": "optional"
    },
    {
      "name": "fresh lemon slices",
      "amount": "2 slices",
      "notes": "for serving"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Press the tofu to remove excess moisture and cut into 1 ½ inch cubes.",
    "In a bowl, whisk together olive oil, garlic-infused oil, red wine, lemon juice, smoked paprika, oregano, salt, and pepper.",
    "Toss the tofu cubes into the vinaigrette until well coated and let marinate for 10 minutes.",
    "Thread the tofu cubes onto skewers, spacing them evenly.",
    "Preheat a grill or grill pan over medium heat and brush lightly with olive oil.",
    "Grill the skewers for 3 to 4 minutes per side, turning once, until smoky char marks appear.",
    "Remove from heat and sprinkle with chopped parsley before serving.",
    "Serve immediately with fresh lemon slices on the side."
  ],
